   313|      `Note: ${input.documents.length} deal-room document(s) accompany this message: ${input.documents
   314|        .map((doc) => `${doc.name ?? doc.url} [${doc.kind}] ${doc.url}`)
   315|        .join('; ')}. Analyze them as an acquisition analyst per the instructions above.`,
